{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Hey Sam, good to hear from you! Since we last talked, lots has been happening! Last weekend, I took my family on a road trip to Jasper. It was amazing! We drove through the Icefields Parkway and the glaciers and lakes were gorgeous. I got a shot of a glacier, check it out!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-49/session_2-909dc38acbf5515ac6b3e12e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T11:02:11.014013+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "909dc38acbf5515ac6b3e12e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "909dc38acbf5515ac6b3e12e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Hey Evan, looks amazing! I've never been to Jasper, but it looks breathtaking. Tell me more about your road trip. Was it relaxing?"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-49/session_2-4290173a1b8221ede1eb422b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T11:02:15.088415+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4290173a1b8221ede1eb422b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4290173a1b8221ede1eb422b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Hey Sam, thanks for asking! It was great - fresh air, peacefulness and a cozy cabin surrounded by mountains and forests made it feel like a real retreat."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-49/session_2-078ddc83ec23b9426e8a73f5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T11:02:19.177487+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "078ddc83ec23b9426e8a73f5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "078ddc83ec23b9426e8a73f5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: That sounds great, Evan! It's so important to take time for ourselves and find peace, especially after a hard week. Mine's been tough."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-49/session_2-a17ebd719d3066907aa15cd3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T11:02:23.254435+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a17ebd719d3066907aa15cd3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a17ebd719d3066907aa15cd3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Sorry to hear that, Sam. Is there anything I can do to help?"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-49/session_2-c63c1cc0d8451ab970cf7262", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T11:02:27.337408+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c63c1cc0d8451ab970cf7262", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c63c1cc0d8451ab970cf7262", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Thanks, Evan. Appreciate the offer, but had a check-up with my doctor a few days ago and, yikes, the weight wasn't great. It was pretty eye-opening."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-49/session_2-f3b7351536baeaabfe489f5c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T11:02:31.444665+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f3b7351536baeaabfe489f5c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f3b7351536baeaabfe489f5c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: That must have been a challenging experience, Sam. It's tough when we have to confront our own health challenges. Remember, it's never too late to make positive changes for a healthier lifestyle. Is there anything I can do to support you in this journey?"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-49/session_2-e851b29064b9f04d8be3a6dd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T11:02:35.560746+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e851b29064b9f04d8be3a6dd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e851b29064b9f04d8be3a6dd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Thanks, Evan. Breaking old habits isn't easy. Do you have any tips for starting the process?"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-49/session_2-afb58628c45f81fccc49b029", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T11:02:39.671264+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "afb58628c45f81fccc49b029", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "afb58628c45f81fccc49b029", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Yeah, what worked for me was finding a fitness routine I really enjoy. It's my go-to, I love the feeling of being healthy and strong. Making it fun and finding little ways to make smarter choices in my diet really added up. Don't forget, you got this!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-49/session_2-bce51ecb197ca4e193331567", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T11:02:43.759953+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bce51ecb197ca4e193331567", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bce51ecb197ca4e193331567", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Thanks, Evan. Like you said, I've been looking for a hobby to stay motivated. I've been thinking about trying painting. Do you think it will help me de-stress?"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-49/session_2-217f4cb89c3a89c8baea46e7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T11:02:47.862988+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "217f4cb89c3a89c8baea46e7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "217f4cb89c3a89c8baea46e7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Of course, Sam! Painting is a great way to relieve stress and be creative. It gives you the freedom to explore colors and textures and express feelings. I've been doing it for a few years now and it helps me find peace. But unfortunately it won't help you with your weight problem, besides painting I recommend exercising!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-49/session_2-3a42e830349013d03fbae05e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T11:02:51.956567+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3a42e830349013d03fbae05e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3a42e830349013d03fbae05e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Thanks, Evan! Appreciate the encouragement. I'll give it a go and let you know how it turns out."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-49/session_2-3850a537f832805d2fa33734", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T11:02:56.042707+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3850a537f832805d2fa33734", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3850a537f832805d2fa33734", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Awesome, Sam! Have fun with it and don't put too much pressure on yourself. Can't wait to hear how it's going!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-49/session_2-01ed62503b9d2a72d8720e38", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T11:03:00.153940+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "01ed62503b9d2a72d8720e38", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "01ed62503b9d2a72d8720e38", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Cheers, Evan! I won't stress - just gonna enjoy it."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-49/session_2-db34cba1cfb2c59f3754d8e8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T11:03:04.247633+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "db34cba1cfb2c59f3754d8e8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "db34cba1cfb2c59f3754d8e8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Alright Sam, have fun with it! Keep me updated!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-49/session_2-ce2d6af0cacc873654fb95b9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T11:03:08.335680+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ce2d6af0cacc873654fb95b9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ce2d6af0cacc873654fb95b9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Thanks, Evan! Will do. Bye for now."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-49/session_2-ec91dde889adc4511583479a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T11:03:12.413366+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ec91dde889adc4511583479a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ec91dde889adc4511583479a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Take care, Sam! I'll catch up with you later."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-49/session_2-317bc7ca1823809d084afa24", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T11:03:16.503842+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "317bc7ca1823809d084afa24", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "317bc7ca1823809d084afa24", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
